  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Sexual and Gender Diversity Network 2021-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the Pacific Sexuality and Gender Diversity Network (PSGDN) to support the establishment of their Secretariat, resourcing, implementation of their 2019-2024 Strategic Action Plan, development of the 2024-2029 Strategic Action Plan, meeting due diligence requirements, and establishment of a grant funding mechanism for the well-being and prosperity of Pacific Islanders of diverse SOGIESC and SOGIESC-related rights in the Pacific.</narrative>
  </description>
